cludes a \n       revised Introduction by the artist, reflecting on the last\n       50 years' work on this project, and 92 new illustrated \n       pages. A Special Limited edition is also available: this \n       presents a copy of the 50th anniversary edition in a \n       clamshell box with a limited-edition print, signed by the \n       artist. \n599    LTIEXP \n600 10 Phillips, Tom,|d1937- \n600 10 Mallock, W. H.|q(William Hurrell),|d1849-1923\n       |vAdaptations. \n600 17 Mallock, W. H.|q(William Hurrell),|d1849-1923.|2fast\n       |0(OCoLC)fst00075506 \n600 17 Phillips, Tom,|d1937-|2fast|0(OCoLC)fst00003294 \n650  0 Literature, Experimental. \n650  4 CHR 2016. \n650  4 PRO Phillips, Tom, 1937- (autograph) (RBC copy) \n650  7 Binding method|vCase binding.|2bkart \n650  7 Binding method|vSmyth sewing.|2bkart \n650  7 Printing / production method|vOffset.|2bkart \n650  7 Printing / production method|vAltered book.|2bkart \n650  7 Artists' books.|2fast|0(OCoLC)fst00817660 \n650  7 Literature, Experimental.|2fast|0(OCoLC)fst01000149 \n655  7 Artists' books.|2lcgft \n655  7 Adaptations.|2fast|0(OCoLC)fst01423910 \n700 1  Mallock, W. H.|q(William Hurrell),|d1849-1923.|tHuman \n       document. \n915    |9Under Authority Control \n949  1 N7433.4.P5|bA4 2016|z050 4|g1|i00051636531|laada|ntpr|h3\n       |fART|u- \n994    C0|bNOC \nFull Record\nOnline\nLocation \tCall # \tStatus \tNotes\nArt Library \tN7433.4.P5 A4 2016 \tIn-Library Use Only \t\n\nSubjects\nPhillips, Tom, 1937-\nMallock, W. H. (William Hurrell), 1849-1923 -- Adaptations.\nLiterature, Experimental.\nCHR 2016.\nPRO Phillips, Tom, 1937- (autograph) (RBC copy)\n\nOther Title: \tHuman document.\nRelated Works: \tMallock, W. H. (William Hurrell), 1849-1923. Human document.\nOther Author: \tMallock, W. H. (William Hurrell), 1849-1923.\n\nDescription\nLanguage: \tEnglish\nNotes: \tIncludes \"Notes on A humument \" by Tom Phillips. [14] pages following text.\nPrevious edition: 2012.\nOCLC Number: \t961308855\